{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S01、S05等短停留段落里的左侧长句偏密，第一眼不如X的短句和加亮词容易抓住。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句和重点加亮更利于快速扫屏，音乐变化的描写也更密集，但部分感受词近义重复、意象连续堆叠，容易让观众忙于接收局部信息。Y虽然文字较长，却把人物每一步的心理动机、行为变化和前后因果交代得更完整，尤其从害怕暴露喜欢、担心失去亲近，到愿意坦然表达，情感转变有清楚的来路；感受词也经过筛选，较少出现意象堆砌。作为边听音乐边理解一段完整情感经历的普通观众，我认为Y最终带来的理解和情感体验更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "453b47be-10ae-470c-9d29-328fb95d3b2f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T062606924199Z", "elapsed_seconds": 106.156, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T06:27:53.093744+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "bf15c846a9ca332f2e133dced6e7b914e0918d56c6a3532c15943d9d2b42caa6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we